WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:03.810
The year is 2205 A.D.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:13.110
To annihilate the History Retrograde Army,
who scheme to alter history...

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.830
...we, who were born from swords...

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.790
...engage in mortal combat today as well!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:47.770
"Touken Ranbu Hanamaru S2"

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:00.640
Master, we brought lunch!

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.180
You're eating here today, right?

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.310
It's delicious when
we all eat together, isn't it?

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.520
"This anime is about the
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:14.400
of a certain group of
Sword Warriors in a certain citadel."

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:19.450
I'll get my revenge...

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.830
I told you to hurry up and sharpen that!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.710
I'll get my revenge...

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.970
You... You bastard...

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:57.530
I'll get my revenge... I'll get my revenge...

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.420
Good morning, Kashuu-<i>san</i>.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:12.620
Morning.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:14.080
Are you getting dispatched?

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.590
Yeah, that's right.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:19.010
I see. Do your best.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.300
I will!

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.530
I wonder what they're planting...

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.370
What is that?

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.780
It is an herb called lavender.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:50.790
The scent of these flowers
has a calming effect on the mind.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.500
A calming effect on the mind...

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.710
I, Hasebe, will exert myself to
ensure that Master can sleep deeply

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.300
even on nights when
the heat makes it hard to sleep!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:04.640
Excuse me. Will you share
some of those seeds with me?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.720
That's fine, but is something the matter?

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.600
Osayo sometimes calls out
at night from nightmares,

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:16.060
murmuring, "I'll get my revenge..."

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:20.070
That child found his life in revenge.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.360
The woman who was his
former master was killed by bandits

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:28.030
and her child got revenge on those bandits.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:32.250
That is the history that made Osayo who he is.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.580
I didn't know Sayosuke had such a past...

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:36.580
Yes.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:40.500
That is why, if it would
help him feel more calm,

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.590
then I'd like to try growing some, too.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:46.930
I know! What if we plant a flowerbed?

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:47.970
A flowerbed?

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:51.140
Actually, on the day
Kousetsu came to this citadel,

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:58.310
Osayo, what's the matter?

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:01.280
I would like a flower like that, too.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.570
Where is it blooming?

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:07.910
Oh, this was blooming a little past the fields.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.580
Thank you.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.290
A present for someone?

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:13.290
For my brothers.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:16.170
Because... flowers are pretty.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:21.130
That made me think
that Osayo liked flowers, too.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.460
A flowerbed sounds like a fine idea.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.550
Taking care of plants also calms the mind.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.260
Yes, definitely.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:32.100
I'd like to plant it together
with Kousetsu-<i>niisama</i> and Osayo.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:35.270
In that case, there's a field over
there that isn't being used.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.730
Use that.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:41.110
I have some flower seeds I use
for medicines, so you can plant those.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.360
Leave the design to me.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:47.320
I've known Osayo since we were
at Hosokawa-<i>sama</i>'s place together.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:49.240
Thank you very much.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.910
Also, here.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.080
What is that?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.990
A fertilizer I'm developing.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:57.500
If you use it, any plant
will sprout in a few days.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:01.500
I'm still testing it,
but it's a little too strong...

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.750
Be careful not to use too much.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.340
I will.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.090
After all this, I'm a little tired.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:48.670
Thank you for your help.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:51.180
Something like this is no problem.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:54.680
I have finished spreading
the fertilizer we got from Yagen.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.810
Good work.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.690
I'm looking forward to
seeing them bloom, aren't you?

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.730
Yeah.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.860
Osayo, do you like flowers?

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.190
I don't know.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:13.370
But I was happy when you
two liked the flowers I picked.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.090
They do not appear to be sprouting yet.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:32.890
Even with Yagen's fertilizer,
they wouldn't sprout so soon.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:35.220
Oh? Everyone's up early.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.220
Good morning.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.100
Is this the flowerbed you were talking about?

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.180
Yes.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:44.360
We keep coming to check
if anything has sprouted.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:48.070
Since I'm here, why don't
I pray for a good harvest?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.490
Please do.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:00.750
Be purified, be cleaned.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.670
Huh?!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:04.750
This is...

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.460
Amazing...

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.510
Wait, I'm surprised, too.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.800
But I'm glad they sprouted.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.470
Yes, me too.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.890
I didn't think they'd grow this fast.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.310
It looks like they'll start blooming soon.

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.810
Osayo is also looking forward to it very much.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.270
I hope they'll bloom quickly.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.480
Where's Sayosuke?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.400
He's on an expedition.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:34.360
He didn't go very far,
so I think he will return soon.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.620
What unpleasant weather...

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.390
Fluttering...

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.970
Fluttering...

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.890
Flying bird!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.810
Kousetsu-<i>niisama</i>, are you all right?

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:09.520
This is nothing compared to Osayo's suffering.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.110
You're right.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:15.150
Oh my.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.240
Gotcha.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.990
Iwatooshi!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.240
Souza-<i>dono</i>, you okay?

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.370
Thank you very much.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:29.290
We just have to hold this down?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.210
I will also help.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.960
Manual labor, huh? Leave it to me!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:37.970
Ka, ka, ka! This looks
like it'll be great training!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.720
It's for your little brother, right? Stand firm.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.740
Looks like we were able to protect it somehow.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.330
Nii-<i>sama</i>!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.160
Are you all right?

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.590
Osayo.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.350
Here...

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.850
For the final touch.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.320
It smells good.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.240
Apparently, it's called "lavender."

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.240
Everyone, thank you, as well.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.170
Actually, this flowerbed has a secret.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:03.510
That's nice!

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:05.640
--What do you think? Isn't it elegant?
--Good job!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:06.100
--What do you think? Isn't it elegant?
--Yeah!

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.980
You made something very tasteful.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:14.270
It's pretty.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.480
Osayo.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:21.160
Is the desire for revenge
still strong in your heart?

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:26.700
I know that you do not like fighting. But...

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.660
I'm not asking to criticize you.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.880
It's something that makes you who you are.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.540
I have no intention of rejecting it.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:42.380
However, we hope that at least when
you are with us, you can find some peace.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.640
Yeah...

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:49.270
Revenge is always in my heart somewhere.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:54.060
But when I started planting
the flowerbed with everyone,

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.690
I only thought about the flowerbed.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.030
Thanks.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:03.030
I'm glad I got to plant it... with you.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:09.540
It makes us happy to hear you say that, too.

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:33.940
"Recording"

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.770
It this thing on?

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:38.820
Well, now we have...

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.990
...a new citadel!

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.030
"A Few Days Earlier"

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:46.200
New brothers have arrived.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:53.160
"56 - Tantou, Gotou Toushirou"

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.000
Hey! I'm Gotou Toushirou!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.330
I'm gonna get bigger soon!

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.370
Gotou, long time no see!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.000
Namazuo! It's good to see you again!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.340
I'm counting on you here, too!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:09.140
"57 - Tantou, Shinano Toushirou"

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:04.090
I'm Shinano Toushirou.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.890
Even among the
Toushirou brothers, I'm prized!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:07.930
Please take care of me.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.390
Same here!

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:13.020
It's getting late, so I'll show you
two around the citadel tomorrow.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.140
--Got it.
--All right.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:16.600
Well, good night.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.690
I heard that there were a lot of brothers...

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.320
But space is even tighter than expected, huh?

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:27.030
For tonight, just share blankets with someone.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.290
You two look sleepy.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.920
I couldn't sleep much.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:44.590
Yeah, I'm glad we have more
brothers here, but our room's so full.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.220
But I want to sleep with everyone.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.970
Yeah, we don't want to give that up.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:53.180
We have quite a large number of
Sword Warriors at this citadel now, huh?

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.310
There's not enough space
for everyone's dishes in the kitchen.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:14:00.770
I wish we could do something about
the line for the bathroom the mornings.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:04.570
If only we could have a more spacious citadel.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:07.400
We don't have the funds for that.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.450
If you're talking money, I have some!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.580
Where did you get that?

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:18.120
--Could that be the buried
treasure from Osaka Castle?
--Found it!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:20.960
But it couldn't have been that much...

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.170
After consulting with Master and Hasebe,

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:26.920
we decided to increase
the funds through stock trading.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.970
We just reached the
amount we were aiming for!

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.930
Good job, Hakata!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:35.810
Having a more spacious citadel and being able
to share a room with Ichi-<i>nii</i> and Nakigitsune

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.520
would make me happy, too!

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.020
I'm gonna go talk to Master now!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:45.570
The old citadel was nice,
but this place is wonderful, too!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.900
What are you doing?

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.570
Hey, Kashuu!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:52.990
Even though the citadel's so great now,
Master's still always in their room, right?

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:56.580
So I thought I'd record things around
the citadel on this new "video camera"

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.500
and bring it to them.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.620
This is for Master to watch?

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:03.210
Master, are you watching?

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.210
Kashuu, you wanna come with me?

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.340
Is that okay?

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.800
Then, I'm counting on you to be the MC!

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.090
Huh?

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:14.300
All right! Then, let's start!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.730
Well, first off, this is the entryway...

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:24.060
Oh, did I surprise you?

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.820
I apologize.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:28.150
What are you guys doing?

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.650
We are purifying the new citadel.

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:32.870
It's important to get a good start.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:37.290
I mean, they might come out, don't you think?

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.160
All sorts of things... Right?

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.250
R-Right.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.090
Then, let's start here.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.090
Welcome!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.840
This is a huge room!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.340
How's living in here?

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.510
It's the best!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:55.760
I'm really happy that we can finally be in
the same room as Ichi-<i>nii</i> and Nakigitsune!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.470
I'm happy, too.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:02.230
This is thanks to you, too, Hakata.
I'm very grateful.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.400
We can make a lot of money
with the funds we have left, too!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.780
Don't get too absorbed in it.

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:13.110
We'll show you our new room!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.740
This is where we usually hang out.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.700
The couch is comfy!

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:23.210
But I'm the most comfy here.

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:26.210
We've got plenty of space,
even when all our bedding is out.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.250
I can sleep comfortably.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.340
U-Um...

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.630
What is it?

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:37.010
It is a wonderful room, s-so I would like
Master to come and visit sometime, too.

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:39.430
I want to fold origami together!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.890
I'll make some delicious tea!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.890
Let's talk about everything!

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:47.480
After you come once,
you'll definitely want to come again!

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.320
General, I'm waiting for you.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:54.660
Come now, if you all crowd like that,
then Mutsunokami-<i>san</i> will have trouble.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:59.700
But I would be happy if you came
to visit our room, too, Master.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.750
We're waiting for you!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.330
Yoo-hoo.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:08.920
Hey, welcome to our room!

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.090
How's living in your new room?

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.340
I really like it!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:16.090
There's an attic that's like a secret hideout...

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.050
And it gets good light...

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.600
It's just great!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:23.390
Kuniyuki, since we've got this chance,
let's all be in the video together!

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.190
Kuniyuki...

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:29.230
You're giving Kunitoshi trouble!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.940
Wake up!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.320
What, you wanna sleep together?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:40.330
<i>--I said, wake up</i>!
--I-Is that all right?

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.370
Oh, yeah... It happens all the time.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.660
R-Really...?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.620
Hotaru, that's enough.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:48.920
How about this one?

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.420
This one's pretty good, too!

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.420
What a stylish room!

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:58.260
As expected of Shokudaikiri
and Taikogane's room!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.850
So, what are you doing?

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:00.510
Hey!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.390
What's with those clothes?

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.810
The other day, Tsuru-<i>san</i> and I
went to the general store.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.650
And they had all these different clothes!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.190
There were clothes that looked like
they would be good on Micchan and Kara,

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.030
so we bought a bunch.

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.990
You guys should come and
see what would look good, too!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:16.740
Sure.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.530
Sounds interesting!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.200
Yeah, so Kara, you come, too!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.830
I don't need them.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:26.160
Come on, please! Just this once!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.500
I have no intention of getting along.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.790
Isn't something like this good?

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.050
How about clothes that say "fighting men"?

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.340
Occasionally, cuteness is also important.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.720
Hey, you're still not done?

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.720
Just one more!

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.100
That's pretty good!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.770
A rare sight!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.640
Traditional Japanese clothes look good, too!

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:49.770
Right?

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.020
How do you feel after wearing clothes
different from your usual outfits?

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.770
It doesn't matter what clothes I wear.

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:57.860
I'm not used to wearing them,
so it's hard to relax in them, but it was fun.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.320
How was it for you?

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:03.700
Micchan and Kara look good in anything
they wear, so it was worth dressing them!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:07.040
It was fun for me to see things
I don't usually get to see, too!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:09.160
If you'd like, I'll choose
some for you next time!

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.710
I'm looking forward to it.

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.010
"Older Brother" "Younger Brother"

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.130
"Muscle Training Room"

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:09.600
Next is you and Yamatonokami's room, huh?

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:10.770
Here it is.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.440
Oh? What's this?

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.610
Oh, yeah.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:20.530
Last year, that Yasusada
broke it, so I was fixing it.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.450
I thought I'd add a
little extra decoration, too.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.490
You're very skilled.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:27.740
But it doesn't look that different from before.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.950
That's because I'm not
the only one who'll live here.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.500
I'll think about it with
Yasusada once he gets back.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:33.670
I see.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.250
Can't wait for him to come back then, huh?

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.800
Yeah.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.720
Where else haven't we gone...?

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.430
What is this place?

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:48.010
I don't know, either.

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:49.930
Wanna take a look?

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.560
What?

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.320
A dead end...

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.210
L-Let's go...

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:23.550
Munch!

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:26.720
"F"

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.430
Fried tofu! Fried tofu!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.390
One slice, two slices!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:31.560
Fried tofu if you look
to the right, and to the left!

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:35.190
Fried tofu on all sides!

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:37.520
Fried tofu everywhere you look!

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.020
I'm so happ--

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:46.030
"Konnosuke's Room"

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:43.740
Shall we go?

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.070
Yeah.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:55.790
Finally, we're all going to say
what we want to tell you, Master.

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:59.460
Master! Even if the citadel is renewed,

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:04.090
I, Hasesbe, will continue to take
care of you with all my heart and soul!

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:08.010
If you ever want help decorating
your room, let me know anytime!

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:09.510
I'll help, too.

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:12.060
Come visit my room, too.

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:14.480
Let's do waterfall training together sometime.

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:16.270
I will join you, too.

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:17.940
Oh no, the battery's almost dead!

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:21.150
Okay, then let's finish this. Ready--

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:23.190
We're counting on you from now on, too!

00:23:54.990 --> 00:24:01.590
"More<i> Hanamaru</i> Next Week!!"
